              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/student/forms/course-change",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "student",
                "forms",
                "course-change"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns `student`, `courses` and `limits`.\n\n`courses` is the proposed-course list with the student's own course removed - the only ids the POST will accept. The course they are on now is in `student.course` / `student.course_start_date`."
